{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a290e19f-95d1-866a-8b92-70c67977c935",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T15:26:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Ricardo Mejia. I have three things, actually. First, I have an old appliance I need hauled away. Second, I need to know when my next pickup is. And third, I would like to know why nobody told me the rules for either one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take them in order. What kind of appliance are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A washing machine. It's been in my cellar since before I bought the house. First, it doesn't work. Second, it's heavy. Third, I am not carrying it up those stairs by myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Big items like that usually can't just go out with the regular trash. They generally need a special pickup that you schedule ahead of time. Metal appliances are handled separately. Let me get your address so I can look up your route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 139 Pelham Street. Historic Hill, up past the church."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 139 Pelham. Give me a second to pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'm just standing in my kitchen. My grandmother's recipe cards are spread all over the counter because I was trying to clear a space and now I can't find anything. So this day is already going great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, well, I hope those cards stay in order. Okay, I see your address. Your regular trash day is Monday, and recycling is the same day, alternating weeks. So your next pickup is this coming Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Okay. Is that trash or recycling this Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check the schedule. [pause] This coming Monday is trash. Recycling would be the Monday after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. First, trash Monday. Second, recycling the week after. Got it. Now the washing machine. Do I just put it at the curb Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I wouldn't do that. If you leave it out without arranging it, it may just sit there and you could get a notice. You'd want to call and set up a bulk pickup, and they'll tell you what day to put it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have to arrange it. With who? You?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:24:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Our office can set that up. I can take the details right now if you like. I just need to know it's one washer, and whether it's at the curb or inside the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's inside. In the cellar. First, I can bring it up to the porch with a friend. Second, I can't do the curb until the day. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Most people do exactly that. Get it to the porch and then to the curb the morning of, or the evening before if they say so. I'll put in the request and a crew will confirm the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And how long does that take? Because I'm annoyed that I've been reading the city website for twenty minutes and it says nothing clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. It's usually a week or two, depending on the schedule. I don't have the exact day in front of me, but you'll get a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back to where? This number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whatever number you want. Is the one I'm seeing on my screen the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0150. That's my cell, so if I miss it, leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0150. I've got you down for a washing machine pickup at 139 Pelham Street. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Well, one more. Does the washer need anything done to it first? Doors, hoses, that kind of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Usually they want the hoses disconnected, and the door secured or removed if it's a front loader. If there's any water left, drain it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. First, hoses off. Second, drain it. Third, tape the door. Thank you, that's the first clear answer I've gotten all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help. Have a good weekend, Mr. Mejia, and good luck finding your recipe cards."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thanks. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
